---
layout: base.njk
title: Events
description: Craft fairs, markets, and other places you can find Victory Sparkle Co. in person.
permalink: /events/
---
{#
  HOW TO ADD AN EVENT (no code changes needed):
  1. Open src/_data/events.json on GitHub and click the pencil icon.
  2. Add an object with at least "name" and "startDate" (YYYY-MM-DD).
     Optional: endDate, venue, city, url, booth, note.
  3. Commit — Cloudflare Pages rebuilds and it appears in the right section.
#}
<div class="content-section events-page">
    <h1>Where to Find Me</h1>
    <p>Craft fairs, markets, and meetups. Come say hi — I usually have buttons.</p>

    <h2 class="events-heading">Coming up</h2>
    {% if eventsSorted.upcoming.length %}
    <ul class="events-list">
        {% for event in eventsSorted.upcoming %}
        <li class="event-card">
            <div class="event-date">
                <time datetime="{{ event.startDate }}">{{ event.startDate | readableDate }}</time>
                {% if event.endDate and event.endDate != event.startDate %}
                <span class="event-date-end">through {{ event.endDate | readableDate }}</span>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            <h3 class="event-name">
                {% if event.url %}
                <a href="{{ event.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ event.name }}</a>
                {% else %}{{ event.name }}{% endif %}
            </h3>
            {% if event.venue or event.city %}
            <p class="event-where">
                {{ event.venue }}{% if event.venue and event.city %} &middot; {% endif %}{{ event.city }}
            </p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if event.booth %}<p class="event-booth">{{ event.booth }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if event.note %}<p class="event-note">{{ event.note }}</p>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p class="events-empty">
        Nothing on the calendar right now. <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a> if you'd
        like me at your event.
    </p>
    {% endif %}

    {% if eventsSorted.past.length %}
    <h2 class="events-heading">Previously</h2>
    <ul class="events-list events-list-past">
        {% for event in eventsSorted.past %}
        <li class="event-card">
            <div class="event-date">
                <time datetime="{{ event.startDate }}">{{ event.startDate | readableDate }}</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="event-name">{{ event.name }}</h3>
            {% if event.city %}<p class="event-where">{{ event.city }}</p>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}
</div>
